OL,3,GNEWSABomb threats reported against
OL,4,Amultiple flights across Europe for
OL,5,Asecond time this week
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights across Europe have been
OL,8,Fimpacted by bomb threats for the second
OL,9,Ftime this week
OL,11,FMore than 10 flights have reportedly
OL,12,Fbeen affected today, with some diverted
OL,14,FIn Prague, Czech police say they are
OL,15,Fpreparing to receive four flights,
OL,16,Fafter threats about an "improvised
OL,17,Fexplosive device"
OL,19,F"We assess the relevance of the threats
OL,20,Fas low," the Czech police say
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
